   <media:title>Highlights: Philippines Pro presented by Philippines Sporting Commission 2026 - End of Event</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/0lSdkj1P76k?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/0lSdkj1P76k/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>A wild Finals Day provided a spectacle finish to the Philippines Pro Presented by Philippines Sporting Commission, and memories to last a lifetime leaving Cloud 9’s remarkable impressions. 

The fans provided the ultimate arena atmosphere of good vibes to witness World Champions Caity Simmers and Gabriela Medina hoist their first trophies of the 2026 CT season. Barrel hunting at its finest, Simmers and Medina rose to the meet the odds to overtake Isabella Nichols and Jack Robinson in the Final, and put their names firmly within the World Title race leaving Siargao Island. 

It all comes down to surfing’s mecca. The World Title showdown returns to Pipeline for the first time since 2019 and the Lexus Pipe Masters is sure to provide all the drama beginning December 8 through 20. Watch LIVE on WorldSurfLeague.com. 



